OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 17 NOV
OL,4,G2200FThe Good Groove with Mark Goodier
OL,5,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,6,     Ggroove. 'Dr. Beat' is also on
OL,7,     Ghand to prescribe a perfect tune
OL,8,     Gfor a listener whose week hasn't
OL,9,     Ggot off to the best start!
OL,10,G0000FOJ Borg
OL,11,     GOJ is live through the night from
OL,12,     Gthe Salford Riviera with Midnight
OL,13,     GMastermind, Wish You Were There
OL,14,     Gand the first Midnight Caller of
OL,15,     Gthe week.
OL,16,G0230FOne Hit Wonders with OJ Borg
OL,17,     GYet another episode of One Hit
OL,18,     GWonders that either feature a
OL,19,     Gsample, or have been sampled
OL,20,     Gthemselves. Featuring tracks from
OL,21,     GBoy Meets Girl, Joan Jett and
OL,22,     GBlack Legend.
